      "clause_b": "cuad_GOOSEHEADINSURANCE_INC_04_02_2018_EX_10___cuad_GOOSEHEADINSURANCE_INC_04_02_2018_EX_05df4e9e__12.4",
      "description": "Bidirectional references between Additional Information and Inspection Rights may create ambiguity about data access rules."
