      "description": "Clause 5.3 places full responsibility on the user for compliance with local laws and lease terms, while Clause 9.2.9 imposes significant financial liability if the user misuses Proprietary Marks. These two clauses interact closely, creating potential for conflict if the user's actions trigger both obligations."
